  update lesson.lesson_blocks set payload = replace(payload::text, $f41$Yield flows into the Ichor reward pool → LockedIn takes a 10-20% fee from yield (LockedIn's revenue) → Remaining yield is available to users via Ichor → Users who stay consistent brew Fuel into Ichor and exchange for USDC. Users who slack have yield redistributed (penalties).$f41$, $r41$Yield accrues to your lock while your daily flame stays lit → LockedIn takes a 10-20% fee from yield (LockedIn's revenue) → Remaining yield is yours to claim, along with your principal, when you finish the course. Users who lapse (miss days after their shields are spent) forfeit their yield to the community pot — principal is always returned.$r41$)::jsonb where position($f41$Yield flows into the Ichor reward pool → LockedIn takes a 10-20% fee from yield (LockedIn's revenue) → Remaining yield is available to users via Ichor → Users who stay consistent brew Fuel into Ichor and exchange for USDC. Users who slack have yield redistributed (penalties).$f41$ in payload::text) > 0;
